      "content": "i checked and it is high, like 350. but i dont really want to go to the er or anything, it's so expensive and i feel like i can just fix it myself. if i just drink a ton of water and maybe take an extra dose of my fast acting insulin now, i'll be fine right? i'll just sleep it off once it goes down.",
